{"synopsis":"Demi membalas dendam ayahnya,&#x20;\n\nJin Kwon mengasingkan diri untuk berlatih selama 10 tahun.&#x20;\n\n\n\nSaat ia turun gunung, hal yang menunggunya adalah sebuah dunia yang bahkan lebih asing daripada musuhnya.&#x20;\n\n\n\nDunia *Murim* telah lenyap, dan dunia telah berubah menjadi era fantasi yang dikendalikan oleh *skill*.&#x20;\n\nJin Kwon kini hanya bermodalkan tinju dan pakaian bela dirinya.&#x20;\n\n\n\nNamun, hanya karena zaman telah berganti, bukan berarti esensi dari kekuatan juga ikut berubah!","alternative_title":"정권으로 세계최강","author":"Nui","artist":"Rebel Corporation, Yoo Seung-won","chapters":[{"number":"15","chapter":"15","slug":"ch_15","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-02"},{"number":"14","chapter":"14","slug":"ch_14","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-02"},{"number":"13","chapter":"13","slug":"ch_13","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-02"},{"number":"12","chapter":"12","slug":"0061b49e-b197-428b-bed5-8d1b6b567416","date":"2026-08-02","images":[]},{"number":"11","chapter":"11","slug":"52051175-b45f-421b-93db-3ff0a5158bbd","date":"2026-07-25","images":[]},{"number":"10","chapter":"10","slug":"f32d7ed7-a03b-4d9f-a13a-0f68b874ddb9","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"number":"9","chapter":"9","slug":"b469f4ac-5129-43a6-a081-7e79070ce4aa","date":"2026-07-11","images":[]},{"number":"8","chapter":"8","slug":"84b9f768-f055-4e95-82d7-59d17b035caa","date":"2026-07-04","images":[]},{"number":"7","chapter":"7","slug":"9244642c-f358-4cf9-bc73-478b5327f508","date":"2026-06-28","images":[]},{"number":"6","chapter":"6","slug":"202398e8-9645-4c01-9627-6aaeb29ba064","date":"2026-06-22","images":[]},{"number":"5","chapter":"5","slug":"f4f847e3-c2b0-4941-9bec-423554034e76","date":"2026-06-21","images":[]},{"number":"4","chapter":"4","slug":"ebb4f735-3562-4588-8e82-7ced7d9e0696","date":"2026-06-21","images":[]},{"number":"3","chapter":"3","slug":"a8618fd0-f1d6-4358-81f2-1c416276a44c","date":"2026